    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Action tremor of both hands; no rest tremor, slowness, stiffness, imbalance, or loss of smell</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No heat intolerance, palpitations, sweating, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No asthma, wheeze, or chronic cough</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fainting, palpitations, or slow pulse</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; worried but not anxious; no withdrawal symptoms</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

